    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_01",
      "hash": "f88a7cd2bc91bf9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Eyaaarrrgh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_02",
      "hash": "f88a7bd2bc91bde7",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh! [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!\\nYou’ve gotta—! You’re not gonna believe this!\\c\\nA P-P-Pokémon... It...it... Gahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0300_dummy_01",
      "hash": "4265395987a06562",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_03",
      "hash": "f88a7ad2bc91bc34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Hah...\\nDeep breaths...\\c\\nOK. Let me try that again...\\c\\nSorry, it’s not like me to lose my cool like that..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_04",
      "hash": "f88a79d2bc91ba81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a house up ahead where this famous\\nPokémon fanatic is supposed to live...\\c\\nI wanted to stop by, because I thought maybe I’d\\nget to see some rare Pokémon or something."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_05",
      "hash": "f88a78d2bc91b8ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But what I found...\\nand don’t freak out when you hear this..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_06",
      "hash": "f88a77d2bc91b71b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That Pokémon fanatic Bill wasn’t there...\\c\\nInstead there was a Pokémon...that TALKED!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_07",
      "hash": "f88a76d2bc91b568",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Eeesh, just thinking about it gives me the creeps!\\nDon’t go in there, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_field_t005",
      "hash": "d1c7a8a879f59444",
